Description: F27 — the canonical client boots a real light client against the relay + Bleavit + Asset Hub topology, classifies both runtimes (10 §5.2), and refuses a corrupted genesis pin (10 §3.1 FE-BOOT-003). 15 §4.8's Zombienet row.
